Resolves #230

- Flesch scoring using the following weights:
```
sentenceWeight = 0.39;
wordWeight = 11.8;
adjustment = 15.59;
```
- Adds test for `formatting-evaluator`

Resolves https://github.com/ubiquity-os/plugins-wishlist/issues/46

Refactored and made some additional changes:
- Reactions are now prefixed with `reaction.received` and `reaction.sent`

@gentlementlegen do you know if `listTimelineEvents` API includes all events from `listEvents` API? The docs are not clear on this, but from my testing it seems `listTimelineEvents` includes all events from `listEvents` endpoint and also additional events.

